menu "E-piano"
config EPIANO_RHODES_VOICES
    int "Physical Rhodes voice limit"
    range 1 8
    default 8
    help
        Other presets retain 16 voices. The optimized physical engine has
        been profiled with up to eight simultaneous voices.
config EPIANO_RHODES_STRESS
    bool "Run physical Rhodes profiling sequence at startup"
    default n
    help
        Runs all three Rhodes presets with 8 voices across five registers.
        Includes hard simultaneous attacks, sustain, low/high registers and
        fast retriggers. May underrun until performance is validated.
endmenu
